WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.956 --> 00:00:16.518
Dolittle did not know what to do.

2
00:00:16.538 --> 00:00:19.960
"I must get back to Puddleby," he kept saying.

3
00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:23.683
"We don't have a boat," Jip pointed out.

4
00:00:24.283 --> 00:00:26.785
Dr. Dolittle had forgotten about that.

5
00:00:29.086 --> 00:00:30.988
Polynesia flew to the dungeon.

6
00:00:31.532 --> 00:00:32.173
"Get Dr.

7
00:00:32.193 --> 00:00:33.514
Dolittle! Hurry!"

8
00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.956
Polynesia whispered to Gub-Gub.

9
00:00:36.516 --> 00:00:40.219
When the doctor came, Polynesia told him about the prince.

10
00:00:42.581 --> 00:00:45.083
Dr. Dolittle looked in his medicine bag.

11
00:00:45.103 --> 00:00:52.489
"Hmmm, well, let's see "Ask him to let you out," the parrot continued.

12
00:00:52.509 --> 00:00:55.692
"We could ask the prince for a boat!"

13
00:00:55.732 --> 00:00:57.153
Jip barked excitedly.

14
00:00:57.173 --> 00:00:58.914
"Good idea, Jip!"

15
00:00:59.335 --> 00:00:59.755
smiled Dr.

16
00:01:03.372 --> 00:01:05.153
Dolittle. The prince waited until dark.

17
00:01:05.654 --> 00:01:09.216
Then he went to the dungeon just as the fairy godmother had said.

18
00:01:09.236 --> 00:01:11.698
"Dolittle! Dr.

19
00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.840
Dolittle!" he called softly.

20
00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:17.783
"My fairy godmother said you have a magic bottle.

21
00:01:19.063 --> 00:01:19.944
May I have it?"

22
00:01:22.526 --> 00:01:24.427
Dr. Dolittle scratched his head.

23
00:01:24.447 --> 00:01:27.269
"Well, yes, of course you may.

24
00:01:27.950 --> 00:01:30.612
But first you must let me out of this dungeon."

25
00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:33.561
Jip reminded the doctor about the boat.

26
00:01:33.581 --> 00:01:38.503
"Oh, and also, you must find me a boat Dr.

27
00:01:38.523 --> 00:01:39.664
Dolittle continued.

28
00:01:40.484 --> 00:01:43.165
Gub-Gub wanted to ask for one more thing.

29
00:01:44.285 --> 00:01:47.307
with lots of food in it," the doctor added.

30
00:01:50.528 --> 00:01:52.869
The prince quietly unlocked the dungeon.

31
00:01:52.889 --> 00:01:54.430
"Get me a boat.

32
00:01:54.870 --> 00:01:57.531
I will meet you on the beach," the doctor said.

33
00:01:57.551 --> 00:01:59.872
"What will you give him, Doctor?"

34
00:02:00.516 --> 00:02:01.076
asked Jip.

35
00:02:01.697 --> 00:02:03.778
The doctor took out a black bottle.

36
00:02:03.798 --> 00:02:05.378
"What is it for?"

37
00:02:05.838 --> 00:02:06.679
asked Dab-Dab.

38
00:02:06.699 --> 00:02:13.502
"This medicine makes the hair grow quickly," explained the doctor.

39
00:02:13.522 --> 00:02:16.983
"That's what the prince wants," said Dab-Dab.

40
00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:22.686
"But it's not human hair," the doctor looked away.

41
00:02:22.706 --> 00:02:24.827
"What kind of hair is it?"

42
00:02:25.307 --> 00:02:26.127
asked Dab-Dab.

43
00:02:26.147 --> 00:02:27.708
"It's dog hair."

44
00:02:31.548 --> 00:02:33.210
The prince was waiting for Dr.

45
00:02:33.230 --> 00:02:34.571
Dolittle beside a boat.

46
00:02:34.591 --> 00:02:37.053
"Now give me my magic bottle!"

47
00:02:37.473 --> 00:02:38.614
he said excitedly.

48
00:02:39.294 --> 00:02:41.736
The prince jumped up and down like a boy.

49
00:02:41.756 --> 00:02:47.881
Dr. Dolittle rubbed the lotion on the prince's head.

50
00:02:47.901 --> 00:02:49.362
"Is it growing?"

51
00:02:49.823 --> 00:02:51.384
the prince asked excitedly.

52
00:02:52.065 --> 00:02:54.306
Dr. Dolittle rubbed more and more.

53
00:02:55.047 --> 00:02:58.390
Then he poured the whole bottle onto the prince's head.

54
00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:04.927
Just like grass, one, then two, then ten hairs started popping up.

55
00:03:05.488 --> 00:03:07.069
The prince was growing hair.

56
00:03:10.652 --> 00:03:11.272
have hair!

57
00:03:11.293 --> 00:03:12.614
I have hair!"

58
00:03:13.214 --> 00:03:14.655
the prince shouted joyfully.

59
00:03:15.216 --> 00:03:17.398
He was beginning to look like Jip!

60
00:03:17.958 --> 00:03:20.440
But he didn't have a mirror to see himself.

61
00:03:21.041 --> 00:03:24.664
The prince ran off into the jungle, singing and dancing.

62
00:03:24.684 --> 00:03:28.027
"Jip! You and the prince could be brothers!"

63
00:03:28.447 --> 00:03:31.508
teased Chee-Chee.

64
00:03:31.528 --> 00:03:33.349
"Poor prince," Too-Too said.

65
00:03:33.369 --> 00:03:34.649
"Don't worry.

66
00:03:34.970 --> 00:03:37.130
In two weeks, it will all fall out again.

67
00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:41.092
I will send him the proper medicine when I get home," Dr.

68
00:03:41.132 --> 00:03:42.132
Dolittle replied.

69
00:03:42.152 --> 00:03:45.114
"Hurry and go before the prince comes back!"

70
00:03:45.474 --> 00:03:46.534
Polynesia said.

71
00:03:49.195 --> 00:03:52.997
Everyone got in the boat except Polynesia and Chee-Chee.

72
00:03:53.017 --> 00:03:54.638
"Aren't you coming?"

73
00:03:55.178 --> 00:03:55.698
asked Jip.

74
00:03:55.718 --> 00:04:00.260
"Africa is our home," Polynesia said sadly.

75
00:04:01.076 --> 00:04:04.258
"We want to stay here," Chee-Chee added.

76
00:04:05.139 --> 00:04:06.599
Dr. Dolittle nodded.

77
00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:08.060
"I understand.

78
00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:10.522
I will miss you both very much."

79
00:04:12.523 --> 00:04:14.644
The parrot and monkey hugged Dr.

80
00:04:14.684 --> 00:04:19.367
Dolittle. They waved good-bye to their friends.

81
00:04:19.387 --> 00:04:21.369
"Good-bye, Dr.

82
00:04:21.409 --> 00:04:24.510
Dolittle!" cried Polynesia and Chee-Chee.

83
00:04:25.011 --> 00:04:26.772
And the boat left Africa.
